<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina 1996 car output to be announced Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Argentina 1996 car output to be announced Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's carmaker association ADEFA will release its 1996 car production figures later Tuesday, an ADEFA spokesman said.</p>
<p>The spokesman said the figures, which will include new data on December output, would be announced around 5 p.m. local (3 p.m. EDT/2000 GMT).</p>
<p>((-- Buenos Aires Newsroom + 541 318 0663))</p>
</text>
